# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../learn_more.rst:23
msgid "Learn More"
msgstr "Læra meira"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../learn_more.rst:24
msgid ""
"We are working hard to expand this user guide and to improve SmartEdit Video "
"Editor, but if you are stuck and don't know where to turn, SmartEdit has "
"several sources for additional information."
msgstr ""
"Við erum að vinna hörðum höndum að því að stækka þennan notendahandbók og "
"bæta SmartEdit Video Editor, en ef þú ert fastur og veist ekki hvert þú átt "
"að snúa þér, þá hefur SmartEdit nokkra möguleika fyrir frekari upplýsingar."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../learn_more.rst:27
msgid ""
"SmartEdit has several `YouTube Tutorials <https://www.youtube.com/playlist?"
"list=PLymupH2aoNQNezYzv2lhSwvoyZgLp1Q0T>`_ available to help you learn more."
msgstr ""
"SmartEdit hefur nokkur `YouTube námskeið <https://www.youtube.com/playlist?"
"list=PLymupH2aoNQNezYzv2lhSwvoyZgLp1Q0T>`_ til að hjálpa þér að læra meira."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../learn_more.rst:28
msgid ""
"SmartEdit has a `Reddit User Community <https://smartedit.org/forum>`_ "
"dedicated to users helping users, answering questions, and discussing video "
"editing and SmartEdit topics."
msgstr ""
"SmartEdit hefur `Reddit notendahóp <https://smartedit.org/forum>`_ tileinkaður "
"notendum sem hjálpa öðrum notendum, svara spurningum og ræða um "
"myndbandsklippingu og SmartEdit málefni."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../learn_more.rst:29
msgid ""
"If you would like to help improve this User Guide, `view source on GitHub "
"<https://github.com/SmartEdit/smartedit-qt/tree/develop/doc>`_."
msgstr ""
"Ef þú vilt hjálpa til við að bæta þennan notendahandbók, `skoðaðu heimildina "
"á GitHub <https://github.com/SmartEdit/smartedit-qt/tree/develop/doc>`_."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../learn_more.rst:30
msgid ""
"If you have discovered a new bug, please `Report a Bug <https://www.smartedit."
"org/issues/new/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Ef þú hefur fundið nýjan villu, vinsamlegast `tilkynntu villu <https://www."
"smartedit.org/issues/new/>`_."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../learn_more.rst:31
msgid ""
"If you need professional support, you can open a ticket by sending an "
"message to support@smartedit.org or `Schedule a call <https://calendly.com/"
"smartedit-support/desktop>`_."
msgstr ""
"Ef þú þarft faglega aðstoð getur þú opnað beiðni með því að senda skilaboð á "
"support@smartedit.org eða `pantað símtal <https://calendly.com/smartedit-"
"support/desktop>`_."
